    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d674">

                <pb facs="0693" n="589" xml:id="pg589"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.111/154.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-12-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 5, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister for Foreign Affairs says that no further extension can be granted to
                    Daniel John, as he has had two extensions of delay, and he will have to act in
                    accordance with his agreement to liquidate his business in the time allowed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
